00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:07.470
Tonight is a big deal. At least Chase actually looks like a real man.

2
00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:09.770
A real man? Are you kidding me?

3
00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:13.030
Yeah. He actually belongs by my side.

4
00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:17.370
Alara, you know what Chase really is. He doesn't even have a damn job.

5
00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:23.090
