9
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.860
Over 2,500 days without a break and that means nothing to you?

10
00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:42.760
Anyone we hire could do that stuff.

11
00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:45.660
Raising Willie? Washing your clothes? Your underwear? Your damn socks?

12
00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:46.960
You think you just hire someone for that?

13
00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:55.510
What are you yelling about? The guests are gonna hear you.

14
00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:57.510
Cal, stop embarrassing this family.

15
00:00:57.510 --> 00:01:00.710
Alara, the gal is starting. Stop wasting your breath. Get inside.

16
00:01:00.710 --> 00:01:04.910
Alara, don't let everyone in there see you with a husband like this.

17
00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:15.340
Cal, just leave. Right now. Don't make this any worse.

18
00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:25.270
Fine. Enjoy your night. Your card. Keep it.

19
00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:28.870
After tonight, you're gonna need it.

20
00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:33.270
You've got some nerve. When we get home, you're not getting a single cent.

21
00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:36.570
Don't worry. He'll come crawling back. You're the one with the money.

22
00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:50.480
Without you, he's got nowhere to go.

23
00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:54.880
Claire, cut off the payment authorization for the gal's final bill.

24
00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:59.080
Understood, Mr. Sterling. Do you want me to have them escorted out?

25
00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:04.280
No. They care so much about saving face. Let them pay for their own damn show.
